# Build context of client/Dockerfile (the repository root): only the
# browser client and the release's small runtime files. The 3.5 GB game
# archives (mirror/p3553) are mounted at run time, never copied.
*
!client/
client/node_modules/
client/dist/
client/build/
!mirror/assets/
mirror/assets/*.decompiled
!mirror/__p3553/
!mirror/ui/
!mirror/classic-hud/
!mirror/sw.js
!mirror/manifest.webmanifest
**/.DS_Store
